+// TestHegelKeywordsAreTrimmed: the categories an itunes:keywords element contributes are its
+// comma-separated words, trimmed, the empty ones dropped, as feedparser reads them; the
+// library splits on the comma and keeps the blanks and the empty words (gofeed/2).
+func TestHegelKeywordsAreTrimmed(t *testing.T) {
